{
  "title": "Loadgen",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Throughput (msg/s)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(loadgen_published_total[10s])",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "E1 gatekeeper latency (P50/P95/P99)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(loadgen_e1_latency_seconds_bucket[30s])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(loadgen_e1_latency_seconds_bucket[30s])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(loadgen_e1_latency_seconds_bucket[30s])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "E2 broadcast latency (P50/P95/P99)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(loadgen_e2_latency_seconds_bucket[30s])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(loadgen_e2_latency_seconds_bucket[30s])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(loadgen_e2_latency_seconds_bucket[30s])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consumer pending",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "loadgen_consumer_pending",
          "legendFormat": "{{durable}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consumer ack pending",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "loadgen_consumer_ack_pending",
          "legendFormat": "{{durable}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Publish errors/sec",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(loadgen_publish_errors_total[10s])",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Cassandra soak operation rate",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (action, outcome) (rate(loadgen_soak_operations_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{action}} / {{outcome}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Failure ledger terminal outcomes",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (lane, result) (rate(loadgen_failure_operations_total{scenario=\"message_soak\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{lane}} / {{result}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "NATS connection and lifecycle events",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "loadgen_nats_connected{pool=\"soak\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{pool}} connected",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (pool, event) (rate(loadgen_nats_connection_events_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pool}} / {{event}}/s",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Reconciliation inflight and invalidations",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 32
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (lane) (loadgen_failure_inflight{scenario=\"message_soak\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{lane}} inflight",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (increase(loadgen_failure_invalidations_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}} invalidations/5m",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (increase(loadgen_failure_untracked_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}} untracked/5m",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "expr": "increase(loadgen_failure_dropped_total[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "dropped on recovery/5m",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Failure ledger WAL and loadgen memory",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 40
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "loadgen_failure_journal_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "WAL bytes",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "process_resident_memory_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "RSS bytes",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "go_memstats_heap_alloc_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "Go heap bytes",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Reconciliation observations",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 40
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (observer, result) (rate(loadgen_failure_observations_total{scenario=\"message_soak\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{observer}} / {{result}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Failure evidence durability",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 48
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(loadgen_failure_wal_flush_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "WAL fsync p95",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(loadgen_failure_wal_flush_batch_size_sum[5m])) / sum(rate(loadgen_failure_wal_flush_batch_size_count[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "WAL mean batch records",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(loadgen_failure_wal_appends_total{result=\"error\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "WAL append errors/s",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(loadgen_failure_evidence_flush_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "recipient sidecar flush p95",
          "refId": "D"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(loadgen_failure_evidence_flush_duration_seconds_count{result=\"error\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "recipient sidecar errors/s",
          "refId": "E"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Room and member lane outcomes",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 56
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (lane, result) (rate(loadgen_failure_operations_total{scenario=\"message_soak\", lane=~\"member_mutation|room_mutation|room_create|read_receipt\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{lane}} {{result}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Room state observer sources",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 64
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (source, result) (rate(loadgen_soak_room_state_source_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} {{result}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "loadgen_failure_observer_up{observer=\"room_state\"}",
          "legendFormat": "observer up",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Member candidate pool",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 72
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (state) (loadgen_soak_room_candidates)",
          "legendFormat": "{{state}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "loadgen_soak_room_pool_degraded",
          "legendFormat": "degraded",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(loadgen_soak_room_pool_exhausted_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "exhausted {{reason}}",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Room create budget and retained journals",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 80
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "loadgen_soak_room_create_budget_remaining",
          "legendFormat": "create budget remaining",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "loadgen_failure_abandoned_journals",
          "legendFormat": "abandoned journals",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Search index evidence",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 104
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (result) (rate(loadgen_failure_observations_total{scenario=\"message_soak\", observer=\"search_index\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "index {{result}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(loadgen_soak_operations_total{action=\"search_index_probe\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "probe {{outcome}}",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "loadgen_failure_observer_up{observer=\"search_index\"}",
          "legendFormat": "observer up",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Sampled consumer health",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 96
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "loadgen_consumer_up",
          "legendFormat": "{{durable}} up",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (durable, reason) (rate(loadgen_consumer_sample_errors_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{durable}} {{reason}} errors/s",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Presence signals and verification",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 88
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (signal) (rate(loadgen_soak_presence_signals_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{signal}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (result) (rate(loadgen_soak_presence_checks_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "check {{result}}",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "loadgen_soak_presence_connections",
          "legendFormat": "connections online",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Reconcile lane capacity",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 112
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(loadgen_failure_reconcile_claims_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}} claims/s",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(loadgen_failure_reconcile_lag_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99 lag behind schedule",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (loadgen_failure_invalidations_total{reason=~\"reconcile_capacity|reconcile_lag_range|lease_abort\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Validity gate for a fault window. rate(...{outcome=\"idle\"}[5m]) == 0 is the lane saturating; p99 lag approaching SOAK_RECONCILE_DEADLINE means operations expire unverified for want of a probe, so that window's verdicts are not evidence. A non-zero invalidation means the run is inconclusive: reconcile_capacity is a run started below the floor; reconcile_lag_range is a deadline past the resolvable lag range; lease_abort means the process abandoned in-flight lane observations to exit before its teardown lease became stale. They are split by reason because they need different fixes."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Loadgen Mongo and heartbeat validity",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 120
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "loadgen_mongo_up",
          "legendFormat": "Mongo primary Ping up",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "time() - loadgen_mongo_probe_timestamp_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "Mongo probe age seconds",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "loadgen_soak_heartbeat_degraded",
          "legendFormat": "heartbeat degraded",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "expr": "time() - loadgen_soak_heartbeat_success_timestamp_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "heartbeat success age seconds",
          "refId": "D"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (increase(loadgen_soak_heartbeat_attempts_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "heartbeat {{outcome}} attempts/5m",
          "refId": "E"
        },
        {
          "expr": "increase(loadgen_mongo_probe_attempts_total{outcome=\"error\"}[2m])",
          "legendFormat": "Mongo probe errors/2m",
          "refId": "F"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Loadgen-side validity gate, not service health. Mongo absence evidence is inconclusive while Ping is down, the probe timestamp is stale, or the two-minute evaluation window contains a probe error. The error counter preserves failures that recover between 30-second scrapes. A stale heartbeat-success timestamp exposes a stuck watcher even when its degraded gauge froze at the last value."
    }
  ]
}
